{"4054310": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Mystery of Myths: Whisper of Depth Collector's Edition", "steam_appid": 4054310, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "dlc": [4054510], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4054310/extras/0c3439f1824aeb5b75a5e1d7426348c0.avif?t=1775547307\" width=1200 height=460 /></span><br><br>This is a Hidden Object Puzzle Adventure: a story-driven, point-and-click experience designed for players of all skill levels. You will explore detailed locations, search for carefully hidden objects from a list, and solve a variety of logic puzzles and mini-games that help move the story forward. Observation, curiosity, and attention to detail are the keys to progress.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4054310/extras/36e433bfc4d0e3b82054c2e583606368.poster.avif?t=1775547307\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4054310/extras/36e433bfc4d0e3b82054c2e583606368.webm?t=1775547307\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4054310/extras/36e433bfc4d0e3b82054c2e583606368.mp4?t=1775547307\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>When people begin drowning in dry rooms, investigator Elijah Reed is pulled into a case that defies logic. Sent to France to look into a series of impossible deaths, he uncovers traces of an ancient legend tied to the sea — a forgotten princess, a sunken city, and a haunting voice that lingers beneath the waves. What starts as a routine investigation quickly turns into something far more dangerous.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4054310/extras/f9d7f2ab95c6a9bf46aad57c92d29b52.poster.avif?t=1775547307\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4054310/extras/f9d7f2ab95c6a9bf46aad57c92d29b52.webm?t=1775547307\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4054310/extras/f9d7f2ab95c6a9bf46aad57c92d29b52.mp4?t=1775547307\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Enjoy a wide range of engaging challenges, from classic hidden object scenes to creative mini-games and clever puzzles. Each location offers a fresh test of your attention and reasoning, keeping the experience varied and rewarding!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🗝️ Investigate impossible deaths across eerie French landscapes</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🗝️ Uncover Breton folklore and its chilling connection to a sunken city</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🗝️ Solve dozens of mini-games and tricky puzzles</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🗝️ Explore richly interactive locations filled with secrets</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🗝️ Find hidden objects, collectibles, and optional discoveries</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🗝️ Use both modern detective methods and arcane tools from Elijah’s occult training</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🗝️ Piece together the legend of Dahut and face the truth beneath the waves</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🗝️ Earn achievements to highlight your success</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🗝️ Make choices that shape the course of the story</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into a world where myth and investigation collide, and every clue brings you closer to the truth. The answers lie hidden — waiting for those who dare to search.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steam